return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-29T10:22:01+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-29T10:22:01+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','A page cache and a Redis object cache for any WordPress site. Uses the LiteSpeed server cache where there is one and its own disk cache everywhere else, purges only what a change affects, and proves its Redis connection works.'=>'Cache ojú-ewé kan ati cache ohun elo Redis kan fun eyikeyi aaye WordPress. O nlo cache soplifire LiteSpeed nibiti o wa ati cache disk tirẹ ni ibi gbogbo miiran, o npa ohun ti iyipada kan kan nikan nu, o si fihan pe asopọ Redis rẹ nṣiṣẹ.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'Keshìsi','Page cache'=>'Ìpamọ́ ojú ewé','Object cache'=>'Àtòjọ ìkójọpọ̀ nǹkan','Purging'=>'Ń yọ kúrò','Exclusions'=>'Àwọn ohun tí a yọ kúrò','Purge everything now'=>'Sọ ohun gbogbo di mímọ́ báyìí','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'Gbogbo ojú-ewé tí a ti fipamọ́ ni a ti sùn nù yóò sì tún jẹ́ mímọ̀ bí àwọn alábàákẹ́gbẹ́ ṣe ń dé. Ṣé o fẹ́ tẹ̀ síwájú?','Full-page cache'=>'Ímọ́lẹ̀ ojú-ewé kíkún','On a LiteSpeed server, pages are served by the web server before WordPress runs. On any other server, this plugin stores each page as a file and serves it before WordPress loads. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'Lori sẹ́fà LiteSpeed, àwọn ojúewé ni a n gbé kalẹ̀ nipasẹ sẹ́fà wẹẹbu ṣáájú ki WordPress tó bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í ṣiṣẹ́. Lori eyikeyi sẹ́fà miiran, plọọgi-in yii n tọju ojuewé kọọkan gẹgẹ bi faili kan ti o si n gbe e kale ṣáájú ki WordPress tó kojọ. Eyi ni ibi ti o fẹrẹ jẹ pe gbogbo iyara ti wa.','Cache pages for visitors who are not signed in'=>'Ṣe kaṣi (cache) àwọn ojú-ewé fún àwọn alábèwò tí kò tíì wọlé','How long a page stays cached'=>'Bii pẹlu pẹlu ti oju-iwe kan fi duro ninu kaṣi (cached)','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'Àwọn ìṣẹ́jú ààyá. Ọ̀sẹ̀ kan dára fún ọ̀pọ̀ jù lọ àwọn ojú òpó wẹ́bù; ojú òpó ìròyìn tí ó ń tẹ àwọn ìròyìn jáde ní ẹ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan wá ààyá tí ó kéré púpọ̀.','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ ni àkókò tí ẹ̀rọ àwárí alábẹ̀wò kan máa ń tọ́jú àwọn àwòrán àti àwọn ìwé àkọsílẹ (scripts) sílẹ̀','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'Àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá. Ó kan àwọn àwòrán, CSS àti JavaScript nìkan — kì í ṣe àwọn ojú ewé láéláé. Ṣètò sí 0 láti fi èyí sílẹ̀ fún ilé-iṣẹ́ tí ó gbà yín sí orí ayélujára (host).','Signed-in visitors'=>'Awọn alejo tiwọle','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'Máṣe fi ojú ẹ̀rọ ìpamọ́ hàn fún àlejò tí ó ti wọlé','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'Tí ó bá wà nílẹ̀ jẹ́ ìdáhùn aláìléwu àti aṣàyàn ìpilẹ̀. Pa á rẹ́ nìkan bí o bá mọ̀ pé gbogbo ojú ewé tí a kó pamọ́ jẹ́ ọ̀kan náà fún olùwọlé kọ̀ọ̀kan — ojú ààyè ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ ni ìdí déédé tí a kò fi ń ṣe é.','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'Àwọn àkókò ìgbé ayé tó yàtọ̀ fún àwọn ohun àkóópọ̀ tó yàtọ̀','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ: ojú ìwé ọjà ilé ìtajà fún wákàtí kan, nígbà tí ohun gbogbo yòókù wà fún ọ̀sẹ̀ kan.','Add a rule'=>'Fi kún òfin kan','Content type'=>'Irú akópa','Seconds'=>'Àáyá','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Ìpamọ́-nǹkan (Redis)','Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working.'=>'Olùgbalejo rẹ nṣiṣẹ ibi aṣoju nkan Redis aladani kan fun aaye yii o si tọju rẹ ni mimu. Ko si ohun kan lati ṣeto nibi; ipo ti o wa ni oke iboju yii fihan boya o n ṣiṣẹ.','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'Ó n ṣe àkójọpọ̀ àwọn àbájáde ìbéèrè ibùpamọ́ data. Ó máa ń ran àwọn ilé ìtajà tí ó ní àwọn oníbàárà púpọ̀ lọ́wọ́ jù lọ, níbi tí àkójọpọ̀ ojú ewé kò ti lè ṣeé ṣe.','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'Fi olùpaṣepọ̀ aṣefojúri Redis sori','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'O nilo ėrė siu phpredis. Ti o ba sonu, apoti ti o wa loke iboju yii sọ bẹẹ.','Redis host'=>'Olùgbàlejò Redis','Redis port'=>'Èbúté Redis','Redis database'=>'Àkójọ-ìsọfúnni Redis','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'Fun aaye kọọkan lori Redis ti a pin ni nọmba tirẹ, tabi wọn yoo nu kaṣe ara wọn kuro.','Redis username'=>'Orukọ olumulo Redis','Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone.'=>'Fun ṣeewa Redis nìkan pẹ̀lú àwọn olùlò ACL (Redis 6 tàbí àfikún). Fi sílẹ̀ ní ṣofo láti wọlé pẹ̀lú ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà nìkan.','Redis password'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà Redis','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'Fi o si lasan ti Redis rẹ ko ba nilo rẹ.','Key prefix'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́ kọ́kọ́','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'Yiyan miiran si nọmba ibi ipamọ dataọtọ nigbati o ko le ni ọkan.','Smart auto-purge'=>'Ìsọ-di-mímọ́ aládàáṣe olóye','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'Pa àwọn ojú-ewé tí ó kan náà rẹ́ fúnrarẹ̀ nígbà tí àkóópọ̀ bá yípadà','After updates'=>'Lẹhin awọn imudojuiwọn','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'Pa ohun gbogbo rẹ kuro lẹhin imudojuiwọn kòkòó, pilogi tabi akori','After a comment'=>'Lẹ́yìn àlàyé','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'Pa oju-iwe ifiweranṣẹ kan nu nigbati asọye lori rẹ ba fọwọsi','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'Paa eyi ti lori abala ọrọ iwọye ti o pọ pupọ, nibiti o ti le nù oju-iwe kan naa kuro ni ọọdunrun igba ninu wakati kan.','Never cache these'=>'Má ṣe kó awọn wọnyi pamọ́ síbi ìpamọ́ (cache) kankan','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'Awon iye aiyipada ti o ye ti WordPress ati WooCommerce ni a n lo nigbagbogbo — kete, ibi isanwo, iroyin mi ati eyikeyi igba wiwọle ti a fowo si ni a ki nfi pamọ lailai, ohunkohun ti o ba wa ni isalẹ.','Addresses'=>'Àwọn àdírẹ́sì','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'Ọ̀nà kan fún ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan, fún àpẹẹrẹ <code>/basket</code>. <code>*</code> tó wà ní ìparí máa ń bá ohun gbogbo tó wà lábẹ́ rẹ̀ mu.','Query parameters'=>'Àwọn ìpìlẹ̀ ìbéèrè','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'Ojú-ewé tí ó ní ọ̀kan nínú wọ̀nyí kò ní ń ṣe ìpamọ́ rárá — fún àpẹẹrẹ àmì àkọ́kọ́-ààyè ẹ̀kejì kan.','Cookies'=>'Àwọn kuki','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'Awon alejo ti o ni ọkan ninu awọn wọnyi ni a n fun ni oju-iwe titun ni gbogbo igba.','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Gbogbo ojú-ewé tí a ti fi pamọ́ fún ìgbà díẹ̀ ni a ti sọ nù. Wọn yoo tun sọ di tuntun bí àwọn alábẹ̀wò ṣe ń dé.','The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything.'=>'A ti fi ibi-itoju ohun elo sori ẹrọ, ṣugbọn ko n tọju ohunkohun.','The page cache is on, but pages are not being stored yet.'=>'Akọọlẹ pamọ ti oju-iwe wa tan, ṣugbodun a ko tii n ṣafipamọ awọn oju-iwe naa sibẹ.','WordPress has not loaded the page-cache drop-in yet. It starts on the next page load; if it does not, check that WP_CACHE is true in wp-config.php.'=>'WordPress kò tíì gbé drop-in ìpamọ́ ojú-ewé (page-cache) sórí ayélujára náà. Ó máa bẹ̀rẹ̀ nígbà tí ojú-ewé tí ó kàn bá ń kó; bí kò bá ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀, ṣàyẹ̀wò pé WP_CACHE jẹ́ otítọ́ (true) nínú wp-config.php.','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'Àpò ìpamọ́ ohun púpọ̀ wà l\'ọ́wọ́, ṣùgbọ́n sẹ̀fà yìí kò ní ìtìlẹ́yìn Redis.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Àì śe ètò-àfíkùn phpredis ni a fi sí i, nítorí náà àìśe ètò náà kò jé kí a lè lò ó, sísí àyè sí WordPress sì ń lo ìpàmó ìrántí ara rẹ. Bèrè lọ́wọ́ olùgbàkà rẹ láti jẹ kí phpredis sisẹ́.','Nothing is being cached.'=>'Kò sí ohun tí a ń fi pamọ́ sínú káṣì.','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'Àwọn àtúnṣe méjèèjì ti pa, nítorí náà àfikún yìí kò mú kí ojú-wẹ́bù náà yára síi.','Caching is active on this site.'=>'Ìpamọ́ wà ní sísẹ́ lórí ojú òpó wẹ́bù yìí.','Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen.'=>'Redis kọ orúkọ olùṣe tàbí ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà náà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀ Redis nínú wp-config.php tàbí lórí iboju yìí.','Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site\'s key prefix.'=>'Redis gbawọ fun wíwọlé ṣugbọn kò gba aaye yii laaye lati fipamọ awọn bọtini rẹ. Olumulo Redis nilo aṣẹ fun aami-iwaju bọtini aaye yii.','Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting.'=>'Redis kọ nọmba ibi ipamọ data naa. Ṣayẹwo eto ibi ipamọ data Redis.','Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data.'=>'Redis ti ni iranti ti o tan ti o si n kọ data titun.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'A ko fi ìgbòkègbòó phpredis sori ẹrọ, nitorina WordPress n lo àfikún ìpamọ́ rẹ̀ ninu iranti. Bi olùgbàlejò rẹ lati jẹ ki phpredis ṣiṣẹ.','WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off.'=>'A ti ṣeto WP_REDIS_DISABLED ninu wp-config.php, nitorina a ti pa ibi ipamọ ohun (object cache) mọ.','The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running.'=>'Ko le de ba sẹ́wà Redis. Ṣàyẹ̀wò olùgbàgbọ́ àti èbúté Redis, kí o sì rí i pé Redis ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́.','Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server\'s logs.'=>'Redis kò dáye tí a ṣẹ̀ṣẹ̀ kọ sínú rẹ̀ padà. Ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ ẹ̀rọ ìṣẹ̀ṣẹ Redis.','Web server'=>'Sẹ́fà wẹ́bù','LiteSpeed — pages are cached by the web server'=>'LiteSpeed — olupin webu nṣe ikojọpọ kaṣe fun awọn oju-iwe naa','not LiteSpeed — pages are cached on disk by this plugin'=>'kii iṣẹ LiteSpeed — awọn oju-iwe ti wa ni ipamọ sori disk nipasẹ afikun yii','Pages stored on disk'=>'Àwọn ojúewé tí a ti fi pamọ́ sórí disk','Redis support'=>'Àtìlẹ́yìn Redis','phpredis is installed'=>'a fi phpredis sori ẹrọ','phpredis is not installed'=>'phpredis ko ni iṣagbega','Page lifetime'=>'Akoko aye oju-iwe','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'A kò gbà ọ́ láàyè láti sọ ìpamọ́ di mímọ́.','Cache purge requested.'=>'A ti béèrè fún sísọ ìpamọ́ di mímọ́.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: a fi ohun elo ìpamọ́ ohun àmúṣelọ́wọ́ mìíràn sori, nitorina a ko n ṣakoso ohun elo ìpamọ́ ohun àmúṣelọ́wọ́ Redis nipasẹ àfikún yii.','detected'=>'a rí i','not detected'=>'a kò rí i','phpredis extension missing'=>'ẹ̀yà-àfikún phpredis kò sí','installed, not storing anything'=>'ti fi sori ẹrọ, ko fipamọ ohunkohun','active, managed by your host'=>'ti n ṣiṣẹ, ti olugbalejo rẹ nṣakoso rẹ','active'=>'ń ṣiṣẹ́','inactive'=>'kò ń ṣiṣẹ́','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Ìpamọ́ LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Ìpamọ́-nǹkan Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Ẹ̀yà-àfikún PHP Redis (phpredis) kò sí lórí ẹ̀rọ-ìsìn yìí, nítorí náà a kò lè mú ìpamọ́-nǹkan ṣíṣẹ́.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'A ti fi ohun elo ifunni object-cache miiran sori ẹrọ tẹlẹ. Yọ kuro ki o to jẹ ki object-cache Zinn® le.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'A kò lè kọ fáìlì ìṣètò ìsopọ̀ Redis.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'A kò lè ka drop-in ìpamọ́-nǹkan tí a dì pọ̀.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'A kò lè fi drop-in ìpamọ́-nǹkan sí inú wp-content.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'A kò lè yọ drop-in ìpamọ́-nǹkan kúrò.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'A kò lè kọ sínú ètò-fáìlì WordPress, nítorí náà a kò lè ṣàkóso drop-in ìpamọ́-nǹkan.','Another page-cache plugin has installed wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Remove that plugin first, or keep using its page cache.'=>'Płọgìnnì cache ojú-ewé mìíràn ti fi wp-content/advanced-cache.php sori ẹrọ. Yọ plọgìnnì yẹn kuro kọkọ, tabi tẹsiwaju lati lo cache ojú-ewé rẹ̀.','The folder wp-content/cache/zinn-cache could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'A ko le kọ sí inú fọ́lídà wp-content/cache/zinn-cache, nítorí náà a ko le fi pamọ́ fún àwọn ojú ewé.','wp-content/advanced-cache.php could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'A kò lè kọ wp-content/advanced-cache.php, nítorí náà a kò lè fi ojú èwé pamọ́ (cache).','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ ìtújáde Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Iṣẹ imudojuiwọn Zinn® ko fun ni ọna asopọ gbigba sita fun imudojuiwọn yii. Ṣayẹwo pe aaye yii le de ọdọ pẹpẹ Zinn®, lẹhinna gbiyanju lẹẹkan si.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'A ko le ṣe igbasilẹ imudojuiwọn naa lati iṣẹ imudojuiwọn Zinn® (%s). Gbiyanju lẹẹkan si ni iṣẹju diẹ.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìmúdójúìwọ̀n tí a gbà sílẹ̀ kùnà àyẹ̀wò ìdúróṣinṣin rẹ̀, a kò sì fi sórí ẹ̀rọ.','Go Pro'=>'Lo si Pro','A cache analytics screen: hit ratio, memory, keys and the slowest cache commands.'=>'Ojú-wò titupọ̀ kaṣi: ìwọ̀n ìgbàtí ó ṣe déede, ìṣùpọ̀ ìrántí, àwọn kọ́ọ̀sì àti àwọn àṣẹ kaṣi tó lọ́ra jù lọ.','A slow-query and uncached-call finder that names the plugin or theme responsible.'=>'Ohun ìfárápá ìbéèrè aláìjẹ àti ìpe tí kò ní àkójọpọ̀ tí ó sọ orúkọ àfikún tàbí àkòrí tí ó ní ojúṣe.','An in-memory APCu tier in front of Redis for the hottest keys, plus prefetching, compression and the igbinary serializer.'=>'Ipele APCu ti o wa ninu iranti ni iwaju Redis fun awọn bọtini gbigbona julọ, pẹlu igbasilẹ iṣaaju, fisinuirindigbindigbin ati igbinary serializer.','Tag-based purging for posts, terms and WooCommerce products, so only what changed is cleared, with the page and object caches purged together.'=>'Fífọ̀ tí ó dá lórí tágì fún àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ, àwọn ọ̀rọ̀, àti àwọn ọjà WooCommerce, kí bẹ́ẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ kí ohun tí ó yí padà nìkan lè jẹ́ nu kúrò, pẹ̀lú ìfọ̀ àwọn kíìṣì ojú-ewé àti ohun (object caches) ní àpapọ̀.','Automatic cache warm-up after a purge, WebP and AVIF images, unused-CSS removal and delayed JavaScript.'=>'Àmúṣẹ gbígbóná àkójọpọ̀ fúnra rẹ̀ lẹ́yìn ìgbà tí a ti nu ohun tí kò wúlò nù, àwọn àwòrán WebP àti AVIF, ìyọkúrò CSS tí a kò lò àti JavaScript tí a sun síwájú.','Scheduled database clean-up with a preview, and per-page cache rules.'=>'Ìṣètò ìfọ̀mọ́lẹ̀ ibi ìpamọ́ data pẹ̀lu àkọ́wẹ́wẹ́, àti àwọn òfin cache fún ojú-ewé kọọ̀kan.','Cache health alerts in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when the hit ratio drops or memory fills.'=>'Awọn ìkìlọ̀ ìlera kaṣe ninu daṣibọọdu Zinn Digital® rẹ nigbati ipin ikọlu ba lọ silẹ tabi iranti ba kun.','Everything on the other tabs is free and stays free. Pro installs on top of this plugin and adds:'=>'Gbogbo ohun ti o wa ni ori awọn taabu miiran jẹ ọfẹ ati pe yoo wa ni ọfẹ. Pro fi sori ẹrọ lori afikun yii o si ṣafikun:','See what Pro costs'=>'Wo iye ti Pro jẹ','Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial, no card needed: %1$s a year for one site, %2$s for five sites, %3$s for unlimited sites.'=>'Gbogbo ètò bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú ọjọ́ ìdánwò ọ̀fẹ́ mẹ́rìndínlógún, kò nílò káàdì: %1$s lọ́dún fún ojula kan, %2$s fún ojula márùn-ún, %3$s fún àwọn ojula tí kò ní opin.','wp-config.php was not found, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'A ko ri wp-config.php, nitorinaa a ko le tan WP_CACHE. Fi define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); kun un.','wp-config.php already defines WP_CACHE as false, so the page cache cannot start. Change it to true.'=>'wp-config.php ti ṣalaye WP_CACHE tẹlẹ gẹgẹ bi eke, nitorina kaṣe oju-iwe ko le bẹrẹ. Yipada si otitọ.','wp-config.php is not writable, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'A kò lè kọ si wp-config.php, nitorina a kò le tan WP_CACHE. Fi define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); kun un.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Ti tọju rẹ. Tẹ iye titun kan lati rọpo rẹ.','Filter this list…'=>'Ṣe àlàyè àkójọ yìí…','Filter this list'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ àkójọ yìí','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó bá àlẹmọ yẹn mu.','Add a row'=>'Fi ìlà kan kún un','Remove this row'=>'Yọ ala yi kuro','Remove'=>'Yọ kúrò','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — àkópọ̀','Overview'=>'Àìnígbàgbọ́','Copied'=>'Wọn ti daakọ rẹ','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Gbogbo olùpúlọ̀gì Zinn® lórí ojú-wẹ́bù yìí, àti bí ó ṣe ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Ko si asopọ ti o nilo fun plugin yii.','Open settings'=>'Ṣí àwọn ètò','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'O ko ni igbanilaaye lati yi awọn eto wọnyi pada.','Settings sections'=>'Àwọn apá ètò','Support'=>'Ìtìlẹ̀yìn','Save changes'=>'Fipamọ awọn ayipada','Tools'=>'Àwọn ohunèlù','Export settings'=>'Awọn eto igbewọle silẹ','Reset to defaults'=>'Tun to si ipinlẹ atilẹba','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Èyí yóò mú gbogbo ètò inú plọọgìì (plugin) yìí padà sí ipò àkọ́kọ́ wọn. Ṣé o fẹ́ tẹ̀ síwájú?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Àwọn àyẹ̀wò fún ìtìlẹ́yìn','Import a settings file'=>'Gbe fáìlì ètò wọlé','Import'=>'Gbe wọlé','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Àwọn fáìlì tí a kó jáde kò ní àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà, àwọn àmì ìdánimọ̀, tàbí àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ API nínú rárá — wàá nílò láti tún àwọn wọnyẹn sí ẹnubodè lórí ojúsé tuntun náà.','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn eto naa.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Gbogbo ètò lori plugin yii ti pada si ipinlẹ rẹ ti a ti kọ silẹ.','Done.'=>'Ó ti ṣe.','That action is not available.'=>'Iṣẹ yẹn kò sí.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'A kò lè ka fáìlì yẹn. Yan fáìlì ètò tí a gbé wọlé láti inú plọọgìnnì Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Fáìlì náà tóbi jù láti jẹ́ ìṣàfihàn ẹ̀rọ (settings export).','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn kọ́ jẹ́ ìṣàpẹẹrẹ ètò Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Aṣọ náà wá láti inú àlékún mìíràn (%s), nítorí náà ríré e wá síhìn-ín yóò fi àwọn ètò pamọ́ tí àlékún yìí kò yé.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Eto %d ti wọle. Awọn ọrọ aṣiri ati awọn bọtini API kii ṣe ninu gbigbe jade, nitorinaa tẹ awọn wọnyẹn sii lẹẹkansi.','Connected'=>'Ti sopọ','Connecting…'=>'Njugbọn lọwọ…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Tí ó sopọ̀, sùgbọ́n ohun kan nílò àkíyèsí','Not connected'=>'Ko sopọ','Running on your own account'=>'Nsíṣẹ́ lórí àkúntì ara rẹ̀','We could not check this'=>'A kò lè ṣàyẹ̀wò èyí','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Plugin yii ko sọ idi rẹ. Fi ijabọ ayẹwo ranṣẹ si wa, a yoo si wo o.','Connection status'=>'Ipò ìsopọ̀','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Ìgbẹ̀yìn tí a ṣàyẹ̀wò ní %s sẹ́yìn.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(ó ń ṣí sí taabu tuntun)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Fi èṣán yìí sí ìtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Èyí gan-an ni ohun tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́ — kò sí ohun mìíràn, kò sì sí ohun tí ó sinmi. Àwọn ọrọ̀ aṣínà rẹ, àwọn àmì ìdánimọ̀ rẹ, àti àwọn bọ́tìnnì API rẹ kò sí nínú rẹ̀.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ìròyìn àyẹ̀wò tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́','Copy to clipboard'=>'Ṣẹ̀kọ́ sí pátákó ìkọ̀wé','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Fi ìròyìn yìí ranṣẹ sí àtìlẹyìn Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'A ṣí tíkẹ́tì ìtìlẹ́yìn fún ọ, a sì dáhùn nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì. Bí o kò bá fẹ́ fi ránṣẹ́, da ẹ̀kọ́ náà ní òkè yìí kí o sì lẹ mọ́ inú tíkẹ́tì fún ara rẹ.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital® lati sevha yii (%s). Da iroyin oke kọ silẹ ki o si ṣii tikẹti kan dipo — ko si ohun ti ko tọ si awọn eto rẹ.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Atilẹyin Zinn® ti gba ijabọ rẹ yoo si dahun nipasẹ imeeli.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Ìtìlẹ́yìn Zinn® ti gba ìròyìn rẹ — ìtọ́kasí %s — yóò sì fèsì nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'O ti fi ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìjábọ̀ ránṣẹ́ láàárín àkókò kékèké. Dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú mélòó kan kí o sì tún gbiyanju rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan si — àwọn tí tẹ́lẹ̀ wọlé dé gan-an ni.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ko le gba ijabọ naa ni bayi — iṣoro wa ni yẹn, kii ṣe ti rẹ. Gbiyanju lẹẹkan si laipẹ, tabi daakọ ijabọ ti o wa loke sinu tikẹti kan.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Wọn kọ̀ ọ̀rọ̀ ìjábọ̀ náà (HTTP %d). Ṣàwòkọ̀ rẹ̀ sí òkè kí o sì ṣí tikẹ́tì kan, ní sísọ nọ́mbà yẹn.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — awọn amọna ati awọn iṣẹ','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́nisọ́ olùṣe','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi eyi pamọ','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Gbale Zinn® fun WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfipamọ́ ojoojúmọ́, ìṣípò padà ọ̀fẹ́ àti ìṣàkóso tí a kọ́ fún àwọn èèyàn tí wọ́n ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ju ojú òpó wẹ́bù kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọja Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra àti tà àwọn ojú òpó wẹ́bù, àwọn àlẹ̀mọ́ domain, àti àwọn ibi ìjápọ̀ tí wọ́n ti wà tẹ́lẹ̀, pẹ̀lú owó tí a pa mọ́ láìléwu títí di ìgbà tí ẹ̀gbẹ́ méjèèjì yóò fi ní ìtẹ́lọ́rùn.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — gba awọn eniyan ti eyi jẹ iṣẹ wọn siṣẹ','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà alájọṣepọ̀ káríayé wa: wo àwọn iṣẹ́ tó ti ṣetan lórí ẹgbẹ̀rún mẹ́wàá láti ọ̀dọ̀ àwọn akọ̀wé, apẹ̀rẹ̀, olùgbékalẹ̀ àti òṣìṣẹ́ SEO, tàbí kí o fi iṣẹ́ kan sílẹ̀ kí o sì jẹ́ kí wọ́n fún ọ ní iye owó.','Style preset'=>'Àṣàyàn àwòṣe ìrísí','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Ilẹ̀kọ̀ sílẹ̀ fún bẹ̀rẹ̀. Ohunkohun tí ó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yoo sọ ọ́ di asán.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Lo awon awco ati iwọn mi','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Fi è yìí sílẹ̀, a ó sì lo àkójọpọ̀ náà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ó ṣe wà gan-an.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'bọtìnì ìwé-àṣẹ','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'A ko tii sọ olumulo kan pọ mọ iwe-aṣẹ naa, eyiti o ṣe pataki lati ṣe idiwọ imuṣiṣẹ laisi aṣẹ. Lati sọ iwe-aṣẹ naa fun olumulo rẹ, o gba lati pin orukọ kikun ati adirẹsi imeeli ti olumulo WordPress rẹ.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'awọn aaye ti a mẹnuba loke','Account'=>'Akawunti','Account Details'=>'Alaye Akọọlẹ','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Àsọkọ ti wà fún ìmúṣẹ. Jọ̀wọ́ ṣàyẹ̀wò imeeli rẹ kí o sì tẹ ìjápọ̀ náà láti mú àsọkọ rẹ ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́yìn náà tún fi fọ́ọ̀mù alábàákẹ́gbẹ́ sílẹ̀.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ṣe o fẹ lati dapọ %1$s sinu %2$s?','Actions'=>'Àwọn Ìgbésẹ̀','Activate'=>'Mú ṣiṣẹ́','Activate Free Version'=>'Mú Ẹ̀dọ̀ Ọ̀fẹ́ Ṣiṣẹ́','Activate License'=>'Muu iwe-alase ṣiṣẹ','activate a license here'=>'mú iwe-aṣẹ ṣiṣẹ nibi','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Jọwọ tẹ bọtọ̀ ìwé-àṣẹ ti o gba ninu imeeli lẹhin rira naa:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Muu iwe-alase ṣiṣẹ lori gbogbo awọn aaye ninu nẹtiwọki naa.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Mú ìwé-àṣẹ ṣiṣẹ́ lórí gbogbo àwọn ojú-wẹ́bù tó ń dúró de ìfọwọ́sọ́pọ̀.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'Ẹya ti a sanwo