e key below and click the activation button.'=>'Ti o ba fẹ lati lo %s lori awọn oju opo wẹẹbu yẹn, jọwọ tẹ bọtini iwe-aṣẹ rẹ sii ni isalẹ ki o tẹ bọtini imactivate.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́, o lè fò ó kọjá fún àkókò yìí kí o sì mú ìwé-àṣẹ náà ṣiṣẹ́ nígbà míì, lórí ojú-ewé Account ìpele-nẹ́twọ́kì ti %s rẹ.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Ti sopọ','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Nígbà tí o bá parí, pa %s rẹ́ kí o sì tún tan an náà.','Contact'=>'Kanṣoṣo','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ jẹ́ kí a mọ̀ tí o bá fẹ́ kí a kàn sí ọ fún àwọn ìròyìn ààbò àti ẹ̀yà ara, àwọn àkóónú ẹ̀kọ́, àti àwọn àǹfààní láìpẹ́ sí i:','Contact Support'=>'Kan Atilẹyin','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Ẹ jẹ̀ wá àìrọ̀rùn náà, a sì wà níbí láti ràn ọ́ lọ́wọ́ tí o bá fún wa ní àǹfààní.','Contact Us'=>'Kanṣoṣo Wa','Please contact us here'=>'Jọwọ kan si wa nibi','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Jọwọ kan si wa pẹlu ifiranṣẹ yii:','Continue'=>'Tẹsiwaju','Contributors'=>'Àwọn Olùkópa','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Kò lè mú %s ṣiṣẹ́.','Country'=>'Orílẹ̀-èdè','Cron Type'=>'Iru Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Awon nlo ile-ikawe PHP cURL fun Awon ipe API, eyi ti o je ile-ikawe ti o wopo pupo ti o si n sise lori ero gbigba data lai nilo eto pataki. Laanu, cURL ko sise (tabi ti wa ni pipa) lori server re.','data'=>'data','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'Aṣiṣe (Debug) ti ni agbara ni aṣeyọri yoo si jẹ alaabo laifọw